kind: note
tags: note idea
Note page: one idea, said once
title end

paragraph start
Use a note page to capture one idea. It holds a title and paragraphs only, so it stays small. When the idea grows, move it to a type that has sections.
answer start
for: q1deb06
asked: Is this one idea a reader could restate?
Yes. One idea: a note stays small because it cannot grow sections.
answer end
paragraph end

